Darkbloom is back in action; 

Yesterday, we went from free tier to paid tier on OpenRouter.

We have fulfilled on track close at 4.5B tokens served and $102K ARR.

We are open network of Mac machines (250 online right now). On average, people are earning $120-200 per month per machine.

If you have a Mac and it's idle most times: put it on Darkbloom(.)dev; 

Tip: run the Gemma 4 26B model.

